2026-07-26T10:18:04.0190716Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0191292Z i /tmp/Rtmp8h023w/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0191986Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0192701Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0193083Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0193675Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0194619Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0195281Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0434161Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0543819Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:18:04.0945295Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:18:04.1108057Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
